    ("Протоколи ламп — з відкритих проєктів: UniLED (BanlanX), led-ble і flux_led (Triones, Magic Home), elkbledom, lednetwf_ble, idealLED, bj_led, ledble-ledlamp, curl_smile, govee_ble_lights; Wi-Fi — відкриті API WLED, Govee, Yeelight, WiZ, LIFX, Nanoleaf, Philips Hue.", "Lamp protocols come from open projects: UniLED (BanlanX), led-ble and flux_led (Triones, Magic Home), elkbledom, lednetwf_ble, idealLED, bj_led, ledble-ledlamp, curl_smile, govee_ble_lights; Wi-Fi — the open APIs of WLED, Govee, Yeelight, WiZ, LIFX, Nanoleaf, Philips Hue.", "Die Lampenprotokolle stammen aus offenen Projekten: UniLED (BanlanX), led-ble und flux_led (Triones, Magic Home), elkbledom, lednetwf_ble, idealLED, bj_led, ledble-ledlamp, curl_smile, govee_ble_lights; WLAN — die offenen APIs von WLED, Govee, Yeelight, WiZ, LIFX, Nanoleaf, Philips Hue.", "Les protocoles viennent de projets ouverts : UniLED (BanlanX), led-ble et flux_led (Triones, Magic Home), elkbledom, lednetwf_ble, idealLED, bj_led, ledble-ledlamp, curl_smile, govee_ble_lights ; Wi-Fi — les API ouvertes de WLED, Govee, Yeelight, WiZ, LIFX, Nanoleaf, Philips Hue.", "Los protocolos vienen de proyectos abiertos: UniLED (BanlanX), led-ble y flux_led (Triones, Magic Home), elkbledom, lednetwf_ble, idealLED, bj_led, ledble-ledlamp, curl_smile, govee_ble_lights; Wi-Fi: las API abiertas de WLED, Govee, Yeelight, WiZ, LIFX, Nanoleaf, Philips Hue.", "Os protocolos vêm de projetos abertos: UniLED (BanlanX), led-ble e flux_led (Triones, Magic Home), elkbledom, lednetwf_ble, idealLED, bj_led, ledble-ledlamp, curl_smile, govee_ble_lights; Wi-Fi — as APIs abertas de WLED, Govee, Yeelight, WiZ, LIFX, Nanoleaf, Philips Hue.", "Protokoły lamp pochodzą z otwartych projektów: UniLED (BanlanX), led-ble i flux_led (Triones, Magic Home), elkbledom, lednetwf_ble, idealLED, bj_led, ledble-ledlamp, curl_smile, govee_ble_lights; Wi-Fi — otwarte API WLED, Govee, Yeelight, WiZ, LIFX, Nanoleaf, Philips Hue.", "I protocolli vengono da progetti aperti: UniLED (BanlanX), led-ble e flux_led (Triones, Magic Home), elkbledom, lednetwf_ble, idealLED, bj_led, ledble-ledlamp, curl_smile, govee_ble_lights; Wi-Fi — le API aperte di WLED, Govee, Yeelight, WiZ, LIFX, Nanoleaf, Philips Hue.", "Lamba protokolleri açık projelerden gelir: UniLED (BanlanX), led-ble ve flux_led (Triones, Magic Home), elkbledom, lednetwf_ble, idealLED, bj_led, ledble-ledlamp, curl_smile, govee_ble_lights; Wi-Fi — WLED, Govee, Yeelight, WiZ, LIFX, Nanoleaf, Philips Hue açık API’leri."),
    ("Наживо перевірено лише BanlanX SP621E. Решта ламп працює за описами інших людей — якщо щось не так, допоможе журнал з телефона.", "Only BanlanX SP621E is tested on a real lamp. The rest follow other people’s descriptions — if something is off, a log from the phone helps.", "Nur BanlanX SP621E ist an einer echten Lampe getestet. Der Rest folgt Beschreibungen anderer — wenn etwas nicht stimmt, hilft ein Protokoll vom Handy.", "Seule la BanlanX SP621E est testée sur une vraie lampe. Le reste suit les descriptions d’autres personnes — en cas de souci, un journal du téléphone aide.", "Solo la BanlanX SP621E está probada con una lámpara real. El resto sigue descripciones de otras personas: si algo falla, ayuda un registro del móvil.", "Só a BanlanX SP621E foi testada numa lâmpada real. O resto segue descrições de outras pessoas — se algo falhar, um registro do celular ajuda.", "Tylko BanlanX SP621E sprawdzono na prawdziwej lampie. Reszta działa według opisów innych osób — jeśli coś nie gra, pomoże dziennik z telefonu.", "Solo la BanlanX SP621E è provata su una lampada vera. Il resto segue descrizioni di altri — se qualcosa non va, aiuta un log dal telefono.", "Yalnızca BanlanX SP621E gerçek lambada denendi. Diğerleri başkalarının açıklamalarına dayanır — bir sorun olursa telefondan alınan kayıt yardımcı olur."),
